WEBVTT

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:19.680
The fourteenth ritual.

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:21.140
Eye drops from the second floor.

00:02:21.590 --> 00:02:22.300
Completed.

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:27.990
Looks like we got through it 
without a hitch, Princess.

00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:31.890
How do they keep coming up with

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:33.880
pointless ritual after pointless ritual?

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:36.440
I mean, what was that? 
What's the point?

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:37.460
That's nothing more than hazing.

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:38.880
There's no other way.

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:42.100
Like I said before, these are 
the rituals that have been

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:44.140
passed down in the Jugglaburk 
family for generations.

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:45.680
No.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:49.440
Soon "there's no other 
way" won't be enough.

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:53.860
This is

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:58.740
that thing where three of those 
cowlicks will end this world!

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:03.080
Now, now, just a second there, Princess.

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:04.430
Why don't you cool down?

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:05.070
Let's just talk about...

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:08.360
Hey, Mariandel, 
don't you think the princess

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:10.630
needs a change of pace?

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:11.530
You're right!

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:12.270
Princess?

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:14.580
Why don't we go find 
something delicious?

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:16.380
We can nip all that stress 
right in the bud.

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:19.010
No, rather than food...

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:24.720
Why don't we go here today?

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:27.020
I've always wanted to try it out.

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:34.220
This is a karaoke place, isn't it?

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:36.480
Looks like they've got everything.

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:37.790
Is this fantasy?

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:39.770
Aren't I in a world with 
a fantasy setting?

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:42.210
How does this work?

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:50.290
Let's just pretend like 
I didn't see anything.

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:04.650
Mariandel, let's order something first!

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:05.390
Y-Yes.

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.210
Hello?

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:08.970
<i>This is the front desk.</i>

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:12.390
We'll start with two 
beers, one lemon sour,

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:13.810
one oolong tea and...

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:15.850
What would you like, Princess?

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:16.980
Hot water with ginger.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.320
One hot water with ginger!

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:20.650
<i>I'm sorry, but we don't have that.</i>

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:24.740
Don't give me any crap,
just bring it over right now!

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.950
Cheers!

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:40.610
Marian, food!

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:42.080
Let's order some food!

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:44.140
Fine, I'll just order a few things.

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:44.900
Hello?

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:46.840
<i>This is the front desk.</i>

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:48.510
I'd like to order some food, please.

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:51.520
Three hundred grams of shashlik, 
 four orders of samosas,

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.230
a plate of sashimi, 
fried chicken, bread gratin,

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:54.940
a plate of assorted 
pickles, baked curry,

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:56.730
whatever you have for 
fried rice, and...

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:59.400
Is there anything you'd 
like to eat, Princess?

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:01.110
Yellowtail collar.

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:04.190
So add on an order of
 yellowtail collar, ASAP!

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:06.910
<i>That will take quite a bit of time.
 I hope that's all right.</i>

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:10.030
What makes you think 
that's okay?! I said ASAP!

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:20.870
A-All right, shall we start?

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:22.250
Let's do this!

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:24.950
So who's going to sing first?

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:27.380
I say the one who suggested 
coming here, so Prin—

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:32.640
Me, me! I'll sing first!

00:05:33.150 --> 00:05:34.810
What the hell is the big idea?

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:37.120
You must not make the princess sing.

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:38.060
Why not?

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:42.320
Once, the princess tried 
her hand at karaoke.

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:45.780
Since she's a perfectionist 
when it comes to singing,

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:48.750
she kept singing the 
same song for 72 hours,

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:51.770
citing reasons such as missing 
her cue, being off-key,

00:05:51.770 --> 00:05:54.700
or that her breathing 
wasn't quite right.

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:55.800
I know about that.

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:56.930
You mean Tsukuyomi, right?

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:58.330
With that older brother?

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:02.390
We couldn't leave, we had no 
choice but to stay and listen.

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:03.340
The machine broke down.

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:06.690
Seventeen people lost control
 over their bladders,

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:08.340
went down from low blood sugar,
 or became dehydrated.

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:12.360
Forty-six people required
 serious counseling.

00:06:12.770 --> 00:06:15.700
There were members of 
the government and military

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:18.150
in the audience, thus the 
various branches were crippled,

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:20.580
resulting in damage that took 
two months to repair.

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:24.040
Do you see, Kon?

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:27.500
We cannot let that 
tragedy repeat itself!

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:29.850
It's like a friggin' land mine.

00:06:35.220 --> 00:06:38.120
<i>And what's with this 
unbelievable tension?</i>

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:40.330
<i>What is this?</i>

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:42.010
<i>Is this some sort of microcosm 
of today's society?</i>

00:06:42.010 --> 00:06:44.340
<i>This is definitely not 
about having fun anymore!</i>

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:51.300
I don't like this song.

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:53.600
Pick another one.

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:56.600
No problem!

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:59.330
<i>Just picking the right 
song is life or death!</i>

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:00.350
<i>What kind of karaoke is this?</i>

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:02.230
<i>Is this even karaoke?</i>

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:05.820
<i>This is totally not fun!</i>

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:10.860
One, two, three, four!

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:13.650
My gender can't be defined.

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:16.610
My dynamite swings around freely.

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:21.710
Which part of me do you want?

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:25.280
The beautiful man?

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:28.310
Or the strongly built woman?

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:33.290
Which one do I want?

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:31.630
<i>So this is what this is about.</i>

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:35.010
<i>It's not about singing 
a song you're good at.</i>

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:39.400
<i>It's about picking the song 
to best mock yourself with,</i>

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:42.230
<i>a sick little game to 
amuse the princess!</i>

00:07:42.970 --> 00:07:46.680
<i>Not to mention, Sis, using 
your duality as a trans</i>

00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:48.720
<i>to sing a duet by yourself 
is too high-level.</i>

00:07:48.720 --> 00:07:53.160
<i>The next person is going to have 
a lot of pressure riding on them.</i>

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:53.990
<b>Pressure</b>

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:55.850
<i>Wait a sec.</i>

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:56.700
<i>I got it.</i>

00:07:57.090 --> 00:08:00.290
<i>This is a brand new form of torture!</i>

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:07.130
I got them both, my body!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:09.890
Wow, that's so you!

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:12.180
You're good at whatever you do.

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:13.680
Hey, President!

00:08:16.940 --> 00:08:18.730
So, who's singing next?

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:21.240
You can't have silence 
when you're doing karaoke,

00:08:21.240 --> 00:08:23.710
just gotta keep it coming, 
one after the other.

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:25.110
You got it, Kon!

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:27.020
So you should sing next.

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:29.490
Don't be an idiot!

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:33.980
I can't read your writing and also

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:35.360
I don't know any of your songs.

00:08:35.850 --> 00:08:38.320
Oh, yeah. That's true, isn't it?

00:08:38.690 --> 00:08:41.040
Sorry. I should've 
thought of that before.

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:46.480
Oh, don't worry about it.
 It's fine, it's totally fine.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:49.290
I may not be able to sing, but I can 
definitely enjoy this fine atmosphere!

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:54.150
So, who's next?

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:09.020
Second up, I, Sainglain, will sing!

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:20.330
Your eyes are looking at me so sweetly.

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:21.840
<i>Damn, this is painful.</i>

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:23.290
<i>This song is too painful to watch.</i>

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:26.040
<i>But he did pick the right song.</i>

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:28.790
<i>I get that you can't do this sober,</i>

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:30.880
<i>but still, it's betrayal to some extent!</i>

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:34.170
<i>Running off into the arms of alcohol 
and leaving us behind here?</i>

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:36.430
<i>How irresponsible can you get, old man?!</i>

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:40.100
Tell me...

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:43.600
<i>I mean, I'm really grateful for 
not having to sing and all,</i>

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:45.930
<i>but what's going to happen after this?</i>

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:49.980
<i>Huh? What?</i>

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:53.280
<i>Those?</i>

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:54.860
<i>Are those tambourines?!</i>

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:58.530
<i>That's it. I see it now.</i>

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:00.740
<i>I was never allowed 
to let my guard down</i>

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:02.330
<i>just because I, personally, was safe.</i>

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:04.290
<i>I need to to pour everything I have</i>

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.620
<i>into this karaoke contest from hell</i>

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:11.290
<i>to make sure that there 
won't be a single casualty.</i>

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:13.170
<i>Here I go!</i>

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:15.550
<i>Behold! I'm going to 
wail on those tambourines</i>

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:18.180
<i>like my life depends on it!</i>

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:19.970
Cat cat, meow, meow, meow!

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:21.640
Fluffy, fluffy!

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:25.270
Fluffy, fluffy cats!

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:30.920
Please hit me.

00:10:37.910 --> 00:10:39.140
What's that?

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:41.620
The people next door are really loud.

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:43.030
I'm going to go say something.

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:44.990
Gustave, wait.

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:46.840
Look, we are all enjoying this outing.

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:49.920
Let's not have any 
unpleasant words today.

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:53.140
Could you stop talking into the mic?

00:10:53.140 --> 00:10:54.290
That is really annoying.

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:57.790
Leon's right, ya know!

00:10:57.790 --> 00:11:02.550
We're here to put the spring back 
in Erec-sama's step, ya know?

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:04.410
Right, Erec-sama?

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:09.550
Don't worry, there are 
still four rituals left.

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:11.900
KT, back away from him.

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:13.250
That's so creepy!

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:15.440
Shut it, kid.

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:16.900
You shut it.

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:18.570
Whadya say to me?!

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:19.990
Just stop talking!

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:21.880
But really, how long do 
the higher-ups expect to

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:23.820
keep pushing us to the side?

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:26.490
We have gathered here today 
neither to complain

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:27.970
nor to be solemn.

00:11:27.970 --> 00:11:29.810
I thought we came here to eat, drink,

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:31.650
have fun, and forget all our worries.

00:11:31.650 --> 00:11:32.390
Am I wrong?

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:35.350
I told you, stop talking 
into the friggin' mic!

00:11:35.350 --> 00:11:38.580
You got it, Leon!

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:40.720
Right, Erec-sama?

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:43.050
Why don't you sing something for us?

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:45.470
Something for me...

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:47.740
Who would be singing what for who?

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:49.850
Fine, then.

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:53.020
May I have your attention?

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:56.360
I, Variation, will sing, 
"Everything Is Mine."

00:11:57.320 --> 00:12:03.860
Everything that is in this 
world belongs to me...

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:12.750
Kitty, kitty, kitty, 
kitty, kitty-cat, meow!

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:18.460
<i>I guess we kind of made it through.</i>

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:20.130
Huh?

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:27.040
Wow, it looks like they have 
a scoring system here.

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:28.760
<i>A scoring system?!</i>

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:38.410
All right, beast.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:39.650
Sing.

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:45.320
I'm not really familiar 
with karaoke, though,

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:47.620
and you can guess how
 small my lung capacity is.

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:52.690
Roger!

00:12:52.690 --> 00:12:54.100
My pleasure.

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:57.340
Actually, I might not look it, 
but I am a passionate singer.

00:12:57.340 --> 00:13:01.980
At the local shopping mall I was 
actually quite the conversation topic.

00:13:01.980 --> 00:13:03.880
To be honest, I was always 
humming to myself

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:05.630
when we were journeying togeth—

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:07.830
We're at 80 points.

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:12.970
Get less than that, and you'll be 
tossed into the stew right away.

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:16.760
This is an official order of the

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:20.190
36th princess of St. Piria, 
Ecarlate Juptris St. Piria.

00:13:23.960 --> 00:13:27.030
The death sentence!

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:28.750
Marian!

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:28.750
Yes!

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:31.280
Bring us a stew, with the pot!

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:33.590
I'm sorry, but that's 
really not possible.

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:38.460
I don't give a damn! 
Bring it right now!

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:41.210
We got money to pay for it, you maggot!

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:47.300
<i>All this time, I always 
wanted him to die,</i>

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:49.350
<i>but this is making me 
feel sorry for him.</i>

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:55.370
Pet! I will support you to the end!

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:57.780
You must not do that, Kon.

00:13:57.780 --> 00:13:59.020
Huh? Why not?

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:03.420
If the mic picks up any background 
noise, it'll deduct points for that.

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:05.720
All we can do is sit back and watch.

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:08.860
All we can do is pray.

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:11.870
<i>Why does he know so much about karaoke?</i>

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:13.240
<i>No, wait a moment.</i>

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:16.660
<i>It's a tiny man! It's a tiny man 
who's scoring this, right?!</i>

00:14:17.110 --> 00:14:17.870
It's starting!

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:20.750
<i>He's put his life on the line.</i>

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:22.590
<i>This is it!</i>

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:38.760
Beasts don't speak, 
they lead by example.

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:45.900
I've tried saying something like that...

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:48.900
<i>This could work!</i>

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:51.910
<i>His voice is a lot 
better than I thought.</i>

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.740
<i>And it looks like the 
song he picked</i>

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:55.830
<i>fits the discrepancy between
 his looks and personality quite well.</i>

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:56.910
<i>This could work...</i>

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:02.290
<i>He hasn't made any 
obvious mistakes so far,</i>

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:06.170
<i>but you can tell that his possible 
death has stiffened him up.</i>

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:08.050
<i>If he could just overcome that...</i>

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:12.640
...adoring things that don't exist...

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:14.300
<i>It looks like he got over his nerves.</i>

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:17.730
<i>Or maybe the extreme 
stress is making</i>

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:20.520
<i>his body release tons of adrenaline.</i>

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:23.690
<i>Still, that's going 
in the right direction.</i>

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:28.650
<i>Pet, stop, you idiot!</i>

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:30.780
<i>Don't flex your muscles now!</i>

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:32.740
<i>Careful with the ad-libs!</i>

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:36.450
<i>You don't want to add anything 
about the second floor or arenas!</i>

00:15:38.990 --> 00:15:42.460
Floor two! Arena!

00:15:46.050 --> 00:15:48.960
<i>The scoring system doesn't 
judge singing power.</i>

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:53.340
<i>As long as you sing each note exactly 
on key for the right length,</i>

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:55.350
<i>you'll get a high score.</i>

00:15:56.390 --> 00:15:58.100
<i>If he keeps this up...</i>

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:02.350
<i>...he's definitely stew.</i>

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:08.110
Thank y'all, thank you!

00:16:08.430 --> 00:16:11.240
Dang, that just felt good!

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:12.970
I could get used to this.

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:17.120
I'll carve that into your grave stone.

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:18.320
Huh?

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:20.200
What are you talking about?

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:21.890
Was it bad?

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:23.040
It was bad?

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:24.360
Don't worry.

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:27.880
We'll take care of the 
stew and eat it up.

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:31.010
It's the least we can do 
for our little friend.

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:33.470
Here's

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:36.350
the score.

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:45.850
Oh no!

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:54.070
That's great, Pet.

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:56.210
Looks like you just got 
the eighty points.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:58.410
C-Congrat... Congratulations.

00:17:01.560 --> 00:17:02.580
Really?

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:06.750
I might be mistaken, 
but to me that looks like sashimi.

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:10.260
Come on, Princess, 
what are you talking about?

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:13.420
It's not sashimi, not red 
meat or white meat.

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:16.010
It's 80 points, no matter 
how you look at it.

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:18.800
You're such a joker.

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:21.310
<i>Sis, do something!</i>

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:25.710
Eek, my hand slipped!

00:17:28.820 --> 00:17:31.730
I am so terribly sorry. 
I'm such a klutz!

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:37.700
Ha, looks like you got lucky, beast.

00:17:49.890 --> 00:17:51.750
Ah, that was fun.

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:55.420
That was great, Erec-sama!

00:17:55.410 --> 00:17:57.660
Uh, I didn't actually sing.

00:17:57.660 --> 00:18:03.530
You put your heart into it 
for me, huh? I'm so touched!

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:06.860
Actually, I was singing, and I 
didn't put my heart into it.

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:13.190
Hey! Leon, we're out of booze! 
Order more! More I say!

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:17.660
Why are you asking me? 
Just order it yourself.

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:22.240
I keep telling you, stop talking 
to me through the mic!

00:18:22.680 --> 00:18:23.950
Hey, stop!

00:18:24.550 --> 00:18:25.870
Let go!

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:28.400
I told you to let go!

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.250
Stop! Stop!

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:41.350
All right, now I'm going 
to sing for Erec-sama.

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:47.520
I'm always looking at you...

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:47.520
I'm going to the bathroom.

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:57.320
I want to sing!

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:07.540
<i>I won't fail!</i>

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:16.260
...protein technology.

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:16.270
I see.

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:17.860
Try ordering it.

00:19:16.930 --> 00:19:18.310
That might be good.

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:20.800
Wait a sec!

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:23.450
If you're not singing, 
put the damn mic down already!

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:24.520
What are you talking about?

00:19:24.520 --> 00:19:27.610
It goes without saying that you 
can't do karaoke without a mic!

00:19:27.610 --> 00:19:29.610
I told you, cut it out with that echo!

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:31.650
I agree!

00:19:31.660 --> 00:19:32.940
Jeez,

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:36.320
you are all so pathetic!

00:19:39.210 --> 00:19:42.630
Says you, wearing nothing 
put underpants.

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:50.290
What? Are you telling 
me that this isn't okay?!

00:19:51.350 --> 00:19:56.170
Fine, have your puny muscles ridiculed.

00:19:57.850 --> 00:20:01.930
Size isn't everything. 
What's important is the quality!

00:20:04.920 --> 00:20:06.550
Guys, stop it.

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:08.750
If you have time to fight over nonsense,

00:20:08.750 --> 00:20:10.850
you should get drunk on my 
beautiful voice instead.

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:14.100
Here it goes!

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:18.830
Master Gustave on stage!

00:20:18.830 --> 00:20:21.070
You ended up stripping, too!

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:23.610
Bad sweet dream...

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:34.380
<i>No, this isn't torture.</i>

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:38.880
<i>This is... This is hell!</i>

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:42.720
<i>That's when I realized...</i>

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:47.550
<i>There's no reason for me to 
voluntarily go back into this hell.</i>

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:55.350
<i>Why shouldn't you pretend to get 
lost or lose your memory at times?</i>

00:20:56.310 --> 00:21:00.650
<i>How happy will I be if I go home 
early and get into my bed?</i>

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:06.910
<i>Yeah. Let's go home. 
Home, where there's no karaoke....</i>

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:29.240
Obey!

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:36.380
Submit!

00:21:36.380 --> 00:21:40.310
Total obedience! 
Total obedience! Total obedience!

00:21:40.310 --> 00:21:41.340
Obey!

00:21:41.340 --> 00:21:45.080
Total obedience! 
Total obedience! Total obedience!

00:21:45.440 --> 00:21:46.300
Obey!

00:21:46.300 --> 00:21:50.140
Total obedience! 
Total obedience! Total obedience!

00:21:50.420 --> 00:21:51.270
Obey!

00:22:23.730 --> 00:22:26.360
<i>Excuse me, we're closing now.</i>

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:42.750
Well, how should I put it...

00:22:43.710 --> 00:22:45.050
I'm glad it's over.

00:23:42.440 --> 00:23:45.150
<i>Excuse me, we're closing now.</i>

00:24:06.050 --> 00:24:08.630
<i>Excuse me, we're closing now.</i>

00:24:10.010 --> 00:24:24.860
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:12.340
The day is finally here.

00:24:12.760 --> 00:24:15.660
The princess will spend her 
first night with Jugglaburk.

00:24:17.220 --> 00:24:18.700
Right now the princess is...

00:24:24.860 --> 00:24:29.070
The princess and Nabokov are 
finally getting married!

00:24:24.860 --> 00:24:29.070
Kon can't get any rest because 
of the "first wedding night."

00:24:29.070 --> 00:24:35.060
Actually, is stuff like this

00:24:29.070 --> 00:24:35.060
even allowed?
